# 01 — Before You Continue

Welcome to the official **Slux Privacy Policy**.

Slux is built for Discord communities and provides features such as
moderation, security, automation, music, utility tools, configuration
systems, and other community-focused functionality.

This page explains, in simple terms, what information Slux may handle,
why it may be needed, how it can be used, and what you should know
before using the service.

We don't believe privacy policies need to be unnecessarily complicated.
So we've written this one to be understandable.

> **If something isn't required for a feature, we don't want it.**

