# 02 — What Slux Can See

The exact information available to Slux depends on the permissions
given to the bot and the features enabled in your server.

This can include:

```text
User ID
Server ID
Channel ID
Role ID
Message ID
Voice Channel ID
Username / Display Name
Server Configuration
Command Usage
Moderation Configuration
Feature Settings
